        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;stateDiagram-v2\n    %% State definitions\n    [*] --&gt; PowerOn\n    \n    PowerOn --&gt; Init: 1. Boot Sequence\n    \n    state Init {\n        direction LR\n        StartWiFi: Start Wi-Fi Server\n        InitOLED: Init OLED Display\n        InitUSB: Enable USB Host\n    }\n    \n    Init --&gt; Homing: 2. Calibration\n    \n    state Homing {\n        direction LR\n        MoveAxes: Drive Motors to Edges\n        HitSensor: Trigger A3144/Switches\n        SetZero: Set Origin (0,0,0)\n        \n        MoveAxes --&gt; HitSensor\n        HitSensor --&gt; SetZero\n    }\n    \n    Homing --&gt; MainLoop: 3. Machine Ready\n    \n    state MainLoop {\n        direction TB\n        \n        state Inputs &lt;&lt;fork&gt;&gt;\n        InputA: Wi-Fi (G-Code Stream)\n        InputB: USB Keyboard (Live Typing)\n        \n        Inputs --&gt; InputA\n        Inputs --&gt; InputB\n        \n        InputA --&gt; Kinematics\n        InputB --&gt; Kinematics\n        \n        state Kinematics {\n            direction TB\n            Step1: Move Macro Belts to Cell\n            Step2: Drop Pen (Servo)\n            Step3: Execute Micro CD-ROM Strokes\n            Step4: Lift Pen (Servo)\n            \n            Step1 --&gt; Step2\n            Step2 --&gt; Step3\n            Step3 --&gt; Step4\n        }\n        \n        Kinematics --&gt; UpdateOLED: Process Next Command\n    }&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="7hGFf9WggpyInr_85DEB-1">
